Recipe (stxt.play.cooking): Pancakes
	Serves: 4
	Minutes: 20
	Difficulty: Easy
	Ingredients:
		Ingredient: 200 g flour
		Ingredient: 2 eggs
		Ingredient: 300 ml milk
		Ingredient: A pinch of salt and a little butter
	Steps >>
		Whisk the flour, eggs, milk and salt into a smooth batter.
		Melt a little butter in a hot pan and pour in a ladle of batter.
		Cook until bubbles appear, flip, and cook the other side.
